id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
42779::$$$message_0351_0000_0000$$$::"Ahh, that feels nice..."::
42780::$$$message_0351_0000_0001$$$::"It does. Wide open baths are a delight."::
42781::$$$message_0351_0000_0002$$$::"...I hope Senpai can come with us next time."::
42782::$$$message_0351_0000_0003$$$::"Why not? I'm sure he'd be happy if you invited him."::
42783::$$$message_0351_0000_0004$$$::"I hope you're right..."::
42784::$$$message_0351_0000_0005$$$::"More importantly, what happened to Rin?"::
42785::$$$message_0351_0000_0006$$$::"I'm not sure. I think Archer took her somewhere...[hfsigh layer=1] I can't believe Senpai would call a girl fat. It's so mean."::
42786::$$$message_0351_0000_0007$$$::"I agree. He could have been more tactful."::
42787::$$$message_0351_0000_0008$$$::"Okay, that was a stand-in for my sister.[wait canskip=0 time=400][hffacechg chara=桜 face=喜 layer=1 time=200] That's what we'll tell ourselves."::
42788::$$$message_0351_0000_0009$$$::"A stand-in for Rin? She seemed rather upset."::
42789::$$$message_0351_0000_0010$$$::"That's a separate issue. Hehe. I feel so refreshed after fighting with her."::
42790::$$$message_0351_0000_0011$$$::"...Your quarrels are always so unruly. I wish you'd restrain yourselves a little..."::
42791::$$$message_0351_0000_0012$$$::"Ahaha. Yeah. I'll try to be better about that... Okay, let's enjoy this a little longer and head home."::
�